[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mA: Event catalog (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mPer-event field schema; deny-by-default enforced structurally. No free-text message channel. Catalog entry required
[39m     [38;5;246mper new log line.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m B: Leveled logger + sanitize
     [38;5;246mConventional info/warn/error API with a global field allowlist. Faster to write, but the free-text message argument
[39m     [38;5;246mbypasses the allowlist.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m A, plus localStorage persistence
     [38;5;246mApproach A with unsent logs persisted across page loads, so a crash-then-reload doesn't lose the logs that explain
[39m     [38;5;246mthe crash. More moving parts and a storage-quota failure mode.[39m
